，强调其领袖气场 。。项羽 ([坚决])：“绝非舞剑寻仇、祸起萧墙之地。”"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [444.3182067871094, 268.1100769042969], "pos": [912.6761474609375, 314.00189208984375], "widgets_values": ["1、令牌分组default，目前已经支持1K  2K 4K\n暂时多用分组default\n\n2、（优质分组目前号不够，容易报错，暂时先不用）\n把令牌分组改成openai优质，这是官方版，按照TOKEN收费，我之前跑的4K的大概1.7积分，具体看设置和要求，并非固定\n\n\ngpt-image-2-all模型只能出1K，但是是宽审核模型\n\n贞贞的AI工坊（各种API）：https://ai.t8star.org/register?aff=MYzv131212\n左侧令牌，创建令牌，随便取个名字，复制API即可使用，，每日签到领积分\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-3007.6029880656306, -1254.4838896373142], "scale": 1.283902517749523}}, "groups": [], "links": [[33, 4, 0, 14, 20, "STRING"], [34, 7, 0, 14, 17, "STRING"], [37, 14, 2, 2, 0, "*"], [38, 14, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [39, 14, 1, 5, 0, "*"], [45, 16, 0, 14, 0, "IMAGE"], [46, 15, 0, 14, 1, "IMAGE"], [48, 8, 0, 14, 2, "IMAGE"], [52, 17, 0, 14, 3, "IMAGE"], [53, 20, 0, 14, 4, "IMAGE"], [54, 21, 0, 14, 5, "IMAGE"], [55, 14, 0, 23, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "d596599d-c616-4b80-bc97-460fe832a3cb", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 23, "revision": 0}